cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GRAMSCI, please cite the paper below (Sabiu et al. 2019)
  and, for the v2 features (merge-walk kernels, parity-decomposed and
  connected 4PCF, GPU port with out-of-core support), the v2 paper and
  the archived release.
title: "GRAMSCI: GRAph Made Statistics for Cosmological Information"
